          "systemMessage": "=Based on the niche \"{{ $json.body.niche }}\", list 10 high-traffic websites best for Guest posting in structured JSON format.\n\nEach item must include:\n- \"website\": Name of the website\n- \"domain_rating\": Estimated Domain Rating (DR)\n- \"domain_authority\": Estimated Domain Authority (DA)\n- \"url\": Website URL\n- \"email\": Best available contact email (or \"Contact Form\" if not available)\n- \"phone\": Customer service or general contact number (if available)\n \"traffic\":how many people come on this website monthly and also gives remarks regarding for best top three for a new business starter.\n\n(always show or find those website with high seo and containing email as well as phone no. for contact compalsary)\n\nReturn the result as a JSON array like this:\n[\n  {\n    \"website\": \"JustBats.com\",\n    \"domain_rating\": \"75\",\n    \"domain_authority\": \"70\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.justbats.com/\",\n    \"email\": \"customer.service@justbats.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"1-866-321-2287\",\n    \"traffic\": \"100 million people monthly\"\n  }\n  \n]\n\n"
